<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HealthCor lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HealthCor lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said on Thursday it cut its rating on the shares of HealthCor Holdings Inc to a buy from a strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Peter Emch said in a research note his downgrade was based on changes in Medicare reimbursement contained in the recently-announced pact between President Clinton and Congress to balance the budget.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/8 to 9-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
